{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"zh-TW","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"空氣芯模型採用 Wheeler 的單層近似法,當線圈直徑小於 ZXQPH0000QXZ× 繞組長度時,該模型是粗略的指導。 它省略了線厚、間距、附近金屬、頻率、寄生電容和測量條件。 對於環形電路,請從其精確的芯資料表中輸入 AL 因子; AL 和滲透率可能隨頻率、溫度、直流偏置、間隙和製造公差而變化。","record_id":"41afa03c8cbba14d934a4cfd20326ff2bb155f0106b04589533a127e874fc549","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.3352255584999853,"source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","status":"machine-draft","translation":"空氣芯模型採用 Wheeler 的單層近似法,當線圈直徑小於 3× 繞組長度時,該模型是粗略的指導。 它省略了線厚、間距、附近金屬、頻率、寄生電容和測量條件。 對於環形電路,請從其精確的芯資料表中輸入 AL 因子; AL 和滲透率可能隨頻率、溫度、直流偏置、間隙和製造公差而變化。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
